2026-11-27 Giovanni Bechis <giovanni@paclan.it>

	* Release 1.1
	* fix filter when using a non default socket path on OpenBSD

2026-11-27 Giovanni Bechis <giovanni@paclan.it>

	* Release 1.0
	* Helper code moved into the new Perl module
	  Mail::MIMEDefang::OpenSMTPD
	* Build switched to ExtUtils::MakeMaker, the distribution is
	  available from CPAN as Mail-MIMEDefang-OpenSMTPD
	* New -s option to run filter_sender checks
	* Pass all TLS macros to the filter
	* Improved RESULTS file handling
	* Regression test suite under t/, GitHub Actions CI

2023-04-25 Giovanni Bechis <giovanni@paclan.it>

	* Release 0.2
	* Implement the relayok command
	* Code refactoring, no functional change

2023-01-16 Giovanni Bechis <giovanni@paclan.it>

	* Release 0.1, first public release
	* OpenSMTPD filter talking to mimedefang-multiplexor(8)
	* Support for the C, D, M and T protocol commands
	* Support for header insertion (at the correct position) and
	  action_delete_header
	* mx_id saved and used when needed
	* Temporary directory cleaned up on disconnect, unveil(2) support
	* Warnings for unsupported MIMEDefang features logged via syslog(3)
	* Works with current MIMEDefang releases
